<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #4CAF50; letter-spacing: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-top: 30px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Verify Your Email for LMS</h2>
        <p>Hello <%= user.name %>,</p>
        <p>Your one-time password for account verification is:</p>
        <div class="otp-code"><%= activationCode %></div>
        <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes. Please do not share this code with anyone.</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>